; Same footprint and position as the other rungs' spacing asks for (240x24
; since issue #59, nudged 10 px toward the middle), so only its permanence
; differs from a static ledge. Default
; timings: 0.8 s of amber warning, then 3 s away. The warning matters more
; here than anywhere else a crumbling ledge could go -- a player mid-climb
; needs long enough to commit to the next rung or drop back to the one
; below, and 0.8 s is about one swing.
[node name="Ledge3" parent="." instance=ExtResource("3")]
position = Vector2(-170, 40)
size = Vector2(240, 24)

